# 14. Combat System

Combat should remain mostly automatic.

The strategy comes from positioning.

Example:

Hero becomes adjacent to enemy.

↓

Hero automatically attacks.

↓

Enemy loses HP.

↓

If enemy survives, it may attack during the enemy phase.

This avoids turning the game into a traditional action RPG.

