# 21. Roguelike Perk System

After completing certain waves, present:

**3 randomized perks.**

Player selects one.

Example:

### Fire Chain

Fire tiles explode when shifted.

### Toxic Blood

Poison damage against the hero is reduced.

### Resource Magnet

Resources within two tiles are automatically collected.

### Critical Shift

Every fifth swipe guarantees a critical attack.

### Healing Craft

Crafting restores HP.

### Frozen World

Water has a chance to freeze enemies.

### Shield Master

Shields absorb additional damage.

Perks should create builds rather than simply increasing numbers.

