# 26. Procedural Generation

Each run should randomize:

- starting tile placement,
- resources,
- enemies,
- hazards,
- chest positions,
- perk selections,
- elite modifiers,
- boss modifiers.

Generation must follow balancing rules.

Completely unrestricted randomness should be avoided.

The generator must ensure that boards remain playable and avoid unavoidable instant-death situations.

